Dialogue: 1,0:00:00.00,0:00:51.20,H_en,,0,0,0,,They threw her to the SHARKS on her wedding day...
Dialogue: 1,0:00:00.00,0:00:51.20,C_en,,0,0,0,,Watch ALL episodes FREE ▶ YT688.app
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.04,0:00:02.36,S_en,,0,0,0,,I'd just become the true heiress of the Shen Group.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.40,0:00:09.57,S_en,,0,0,0,,But just two hours earlier,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.61,0:00:12.93,S_en,,0,0,0,,the fake daughter the Shens raised for twenty years
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.97,0:00:15.85,S_en,,0,0,0,,deliberately dumped me into these
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.89,0:00:24.60,S_en,,0,0,0,,shark-infested waters.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.64,0:00:27.08,S_en,,0,0,0,,Why?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.12,0:00:30.29,S_en,,0,0,0,,WHY?!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.33,0:00:34.67,S_en,,0,0,0,,This wedding gift? I prepared it just for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.71,0:00:36.63,S_en,,0,0,0,,Until you 'come back',
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.67,0:00:38.80,S_en,,0,0,0,,I'm the Shen family's only daughter.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.84,0:00:40.00,S_en,,0,0,0,,Mom and Dad adore me.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.04,0:00:41.64,S_en,,0,0,0,,My brothers protect me.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.68,0:00:43.53,S_en,,0,0,0,,Even Brother Mo...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.57,0:00:51.18,S_en,,0,0,0,,was always meant to be mine.
